  "body": "In the Path state, step 2.3 states:\r\n> UTF-8 percent encode c using the path percent-encode set, and append the result to buffer. \r\n\r\nFrom what I can tell, buffer is a sequence of decoded code points. I don't think we can append percent encoded bytes to buffer, unless everything else is implicitly encoding everything that is being appended to buffer.",
